rtin_the_destruction_of_sodom_and_gomorrah","line":42,"path":"gitignore/lyric_video_pictures/bsb_REV_13/pd_martin_the_destruction_of_sodom_and_gomorrah.png","start":null,"end":null},{"scene":"pending","name":"pd_steen_beware_of_luxury","line":44,"path":"gitignore/lyric_video_pictures/bsb_REV_13/pd_steen_beware_of_luxury.png","start":null,"end":null},{"scene":"pending","name":"pd_robert_statue","line":46,"path":"gitignore/lyric_video_pictures/bsb_REV_13/pd_robert_statue.png","start":null,"end":null},{"scene":"pending","name":"pd_rembrandt_idol_bel","line":48,"path":"gitignore/lyric_video_pictures/bsb_REV_13/pd_rembrandt_idol_bel.png","start":null,"end":null},{"scene":"pending","name":"pd_surikov_the_morning_of_the_streltsy_execution","line":50,"path":"gitignore/lyric_video_pictures/bsb_REV_13/pd_surikov_the_morning_of_the_streltsy_execution.png","start":null,"end":null},{"scene":"pending","name":"pd_maes_handen","line":52,"path":"gitignore/lyric_video_pictures/bsb_REV_13/pd_maes_handen.png","start":null,"end":null},{"scene":"pending","name":"pd_van_reymerswaele_a_moneychanger_and_his_wife","line":54,"path":"gitignore/lyric_video_pictures/bsb_REV_13/pd_van_reymerswaele_a_moneychanger_and_his_wife.png","start":null,"end":null},{"scene":"pending","name":"pd_rembrandt_filosoof","line":56,"path":"gitignore/lyric_video_pictures/bsb_REV_13/pd_rembrandt_filosoof.png","start":null,"end":null},{"scene":"pending","name":"pd_durer_the_rider_with_the_scales","line":58,"path":"gitignore/lyric_video_pictures/bsb_REV_13/pd_durer_the_rider_with_the_scales.png","start":null}],"lines":[{"text":"Then I saw a beast with ten horns and seven heads"},{"text":"rising out of the sea."},{"text":"There were ten royal crowns on its horns"},{"text":"and blasphemous names on its heads."},{"text":"The beast I saw was like a leopard,"},{"text":"with the feet of a bear and the mouth of a lion."},{"text":"And the dragon gave the beast his power"},{"text":"and his throne and great authority."},{"text":"One of the heads of the beast appeared to be mortally wounded."},{"text":"But the mortal wound was healed,"},{"text":"and the whole world marveled and followed the beast."},{"text":"They worshiped the dragon who had given authority to the beast,"},{"text":"and they worshiped the beast, saying,"},{"text":"Who is like the beast,"},{"text":"and who can wage war against it?"},{"text":"The beast was given a mouth to speak arrogant and blasphemous words,"},{"text":"and authority to act for 42 months."},{"text":"And the beast opened its mouth to speak blasphemies against God"},{"text":"and to slander His name and His tabernacle,"},{"text":"those who dwell in heaven."},{"text":"Then the beast was permitted to wage war against the saints"},{"text":"and to conquer them,"},{"text":"and it was given authority over every tribe and people"},{"text":"and tongue and nation."},{"text":"And all who dwell on the earth will worship the beast,"},{"text":"all whose names have not been written from the foundation of the world"},{"text":"in the Book of Life belonging to the Lamb who was slain."},{"text":"He who has an ear,"},{"text":"let him hear:"},{"text":"If anyone is destined for captivity,"},{"text":"into captivity he will go;"},{"text":"if anyone is to die by the sword,"},{"text":"by the sword he must be killed."},{"text":"Here is a call for the perseverance and faith of the saints."},{"text":"Then I saw another beast rising out of the earth."},{"text":"This beast had two horns like a lamb,"},{"text":"but spoke like a dragon."},{"text":"And this beast exercised all the authority of the first beast"},{"text":"and caused the earth and those who dwell in it"},{"text":"to worship the first beast,"},{"text":"whose mortal wound had been healed."},{"text":"And the second beast performed great signs"},{"text":"to cause even fire from heaven to come down to earth"},{"text":"in the presence of the people."},{"text":"Because of the signs it was given to perform on behalf of the first beast,"},{"text":"it deceived those who dwell on the earth,"},{"text":"telling them to make an image to the beast"},{"text":"that had been wounded by the sword and yet had lived."},{"text":"The second beast was permitted to give breath to the image of the first beast,"},{"text":"so that the image could speak"},{"text":"and cause all who refused to worship it to be killed."},{"text":"And the second beast required all people small and great,"},{"text":"rich and poor, free and slave,"},{"text":"to receive a mark on their right hand or on their forehead,"},{"text":"so that no one could buy or sell unless he had the mark,"},{"text":"the name of the beast or the number of its name."},{"text":"Here is a call for wisdom:"},{"text":"Let the one who has insight calculate the number of the beast,"},{"text":"for it is the number of a man,"},{"text":"and that number is 666."}]}
